.env
.env.local

# Go build artifacts
crypto-futures-arbitrage-scanner
*.exe
*.test
*.out

# One per command in cmd/: `go build ./cmd/scanner/` drops a 17 MB binary
# named after the package IN THE REPO ROOT, and the line above only covers the
# module's old name. Anchored with a leading slash so a future package or
# directory of the same name deeper in the tree is not swallowed too.
/scanner
/backfill
/backtest
/pairscreen
/paperledger
/fundingcheck

# macOS
.DS_Store

# CodeGraph index (local, machine-specific)
.codegraph/
.soak/

# SQLite store (step 2.6) — data, not source. WAL and shared-memory siblings too.
data/
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
.paper/
